        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"3ddd746f-2fa6-441e-a88e-8ecdff949635\",\"review_text\":\"Phone broken, bought new one, install Spotify and it won't play songs. My library is on home screen but not in library. Want my subscription money back. Plays on wife's phone but not mine, in fact every time I start Spotify it starts on her phone. Guess you idiots don't even look at these.\"},{\"review_id\":\"b1f6fbe5-73d0-4c20-84e7-a7012acc1aff\",\"review_text\":\"Love my toby Keith music especially peso In my pocket\"},{\"review_id\":\"b01dbec6-0fd8-4b86-ad51-b95c79f57f1f\",\"review_text\":\"Best Music App.. Music quality:- Excellent Collection:- Mind Blowing\"},{\"review_id\":\"6eb00a8e-4364-4252-834a-7cbc3fcefa84\",\"review_text\":\"The experience is a breeze.\"},{\"review_id\":\"a565299f-bc20-4747-afed-46c53b028ecf\",\"review_text\":\"WHEN I PUT A PLAYLIST ON IT PLAYS A BUNCH OF RAMDOM SONGS THAT ARE NOT ON MY PLAYLIST\"},{\"review_id\":\"4514674b-9573-4918-96b4-61e0515269cb\",\"review_text\":\"Music 🎵 heaven\"},{\"review_id\":\"aac2316f-311e-44ba-905b-0b0552c6d6a7\",\"review_text\":\"Daily use can't live without it\"},{\"review_id\":\"5d08fe90-65e2-4272-aef2-e6c919738195\",\"review_text\":\"I love the app just don't like that fb messenger makes the Spotify page freeze or glitch needing to be refreshed and sometimes it skips during songs like a old CD lol. I like the set up in general great for sharing and finding all kinds of music 🥰\"},{\"review_id\":\"d8658e4b-d3d9-418f-a964-01e7528d4974\",\"review_text\":\"Please Give download button Please download the song\"},{\"review_id\":\"4064ce93-ecc4-4b8a-bf45-d48e8b119ddd\",\"review_text\":\"The quality is worsening The new feature are very bad\"}]}"
